SOAPBOX: 3rd major RTTY test,starting to get the hang of this now. Behind
SOAPBOX: the scenes swearing at my operating cockups were much less. Band
SOAPBOX: amazing all Saturday,but a massive fight to retain a run QRG.
SOAPBOX: Had to beam East often to try to shift EU when I wanted to be
SOAPBOX: running to the West.Downside of band in amazing shape I guess.
SOAPBOX: Sunday started very poor.If Sat had been like Sunday I think I
SOAPBOX: would have packed up and gone home! But late afternoon it
SOAPBOX: opened right up again to the West with loads of HUGE W & VE sigs.
SOAPBOX: All in all very enjoyable,helped by uncharacteristic good weather
SOAPBOX: on my summit.
